{"title":"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3af78bff816d3b1ea75e97eb6bc7e71b1ae1702d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 2N + 3N + 4N = 10 + 20 + 30 + 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"326\" height=\"16\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f3a2a006e88692a24e42d6f5269d6a8e781b79c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 100\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"330\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b8478fb56be97f885a8a57458fbf51bc0a3930b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3N + 7N = 30 + 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29fbdc9c9852d20f2f20ba8dbf3347843c683332.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10N = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d5413cafd8d1f15192018dbcb0c1ba08208cdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = \\frac{100}{10} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> from the left-hand side of the equation and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from the right-hand side, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/9/9795911e0799f3ae62879c9135ebfdec37a82b6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N(1 + 2 + 3 + 4) = 10(1 + 2 + 3 + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/2/fc295706a1380c4af2ed52211cf866fa73d5e983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" /> is clearly <i>not</i> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because it is a sum of four positive integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/6/5d6aee4c00f5c12564deacd458138cc1710d35c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC\" title=\"2023 CLMC\">2023 CLMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 CLMC Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canada_Lynx_Mathematical_Competition\" title=\"Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition\">Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: